    aliased_import_shadowed_by_local_fn_native_codegen_2026-09-03, 50, "2026-11-05 W3b re-check on stage3 s3_fable44 (fixtures C:/dev/p3new/s3sanity/root/test/w3/w3_alias,w3_alias2,w3_two): premise UNTESTABLE on this binary. Every 2-uncached-module native-build (w3_two plain import, w3_alias2 alias without shadow, w3_alias) AVs 0xC0000005 in codegen with 'AOT compile error ... unit (bare): H<code bytes> reason capsule-not-found name-len=35'. Root cause (not alias): driver_aot_native_output.spl passed builder.build(_compile_frozen_module_capsule(..., _1)); by placeholder scoping (build is not a higher-order callee) the inner _1 desugars to its own identity lambda, so the unit-name text param received a fn pointer to __lambda_lift (disasm: lambda_lift = mov rcx,rax; ret = 48 89 c8 c3, the garbage bytes). Single-module repro test/w3/w3_ph.spl: drive(comp(b,..,s,_1)) -> runtime AV. Already fixed on release by 45fb9585333 (explicit closures + scripts/check/check-no-placeholder-callbacks.shs). Alias premise must be re-run on the first stage3 built with 45fb9585333; keep open."
    aliased_import_shadowed_by_local_fn_native_codegen_2026-09-03, 50, "2026-11-05 W3b re-check on stage3 s3_fable44 (fixtures C:/dev/p3new/s3sanity/root/test/w3/w3_alias,w3_alias2,w3_two): premise UNTESTABLE on this binary. Every 2-uncached-module native-build (w3_two plain import, w3_alias2 alias without shadow, w3_alias) AVs 0xC0000005 in codegen with 'AOT compile error ... unit (bare): H<code bytes> reason capsule-not-found name-len=35'. Root cause (not alias): driver_aot_native_output.spl passed builder.build(_compile_frozen_module_capsule(..., _1)); by placeholder scoping (build is not a higher-order callee) the inner _1 desugars to its own identity lambda, so the unit-name text param received a fn pointer to __lambda_lift (disasm: lambda_lift = mov rcx,rax; ret = 48 89 c8 c3, the garbage bytes). Single-module repro test/w3/w3_ph.spl: drive(comp(b,..,s,_1)) -> runtime AV. Already fixed on release by 45fb9585333 (explicit closures + scripts/check/check-no-placeholder-callbacks.shs). Alias premise must be re-run on the first stage3 built with 45fb9585333; keep open."

